49
00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:52.320
and it doesn't break down naturally very easily.

50
00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.570
It is, you wanna try?

51
00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:55.911
Chewing gum.

52
00:01:55.911 --> 00:02:00.911
Okay Danny now get nervous.

53
00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.910
All right, here we go.

54
00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:04.430
Oh sorry what?

55
00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:06.100
And okay here's the solution

56
00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.820
