60
00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:22.341
Which ocean has the largest accumulation of plastic?

61
00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:25.759
I think that was a charity wait.

62
00:02:25.759 --> 00:02:29.803
I'm gonna say Pacific.

63
00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.630 line:15%
This is known as the area

64
00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.180
