65
00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:38.170
And if you want to see on our globe

66
00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.640
this is literally where it is.

67
00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.890
And one thing that we can all do to reduce ocean plastic

68
00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.440
is to participate in beach cleanups

69
00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:50.090
or simply pick up trash on the ground when we see it.

70
00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:51.930
By the way, the Pacific ocean, because it's so large

71
00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:53.460
that's where we drop satellites

72
00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.980
