75
00:02:56.646 --> 00:02:58.630
So Skylab is in the Pacific ocean.

76
00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.410
Yeah, that's the big toilet bowl for space debris.

77
00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.970
Oh, I hate that the ocean is a toilet bowl.

78
00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.340
