79
00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:06.323
Reuse.

80
00:03:06.323 --> 00:03:09.573
(upbeat music playing)

81
00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:14.380
A great way to reuse food is to compost,

82
00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.420
