84
00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:25.600
Danny seemed to get that buzzer.

85
00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.450
Threw a loophole.

86
00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.760
I'm gonna go with dryer lint

87
00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.480
