88
00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:31.470
And no.

89
00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:32.443
Oh.

90
00:03:32.443 --> 00:03:33.276
(everyone laughing)

91
00:03:33.276 --> 00:03:36.610
And if you dry synthetic fibers that are in the lint

92
00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.870
so they're not technically compostable,

93
00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.190
go to Twitter.

94
00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.200
Okay.

95
00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.512
Neil your turn.

96
00:03:43.512 --> 00:03:45.880
I was gonna say dryer lint too.

97
00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:46.810
Yeah.
Okay

98
00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.280
you guys guess what?

99
00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.550
It is none of that.

100
00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.660
It is fish bones.

101
00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.640
Fish bones and other animal bones

102
00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:56.800
