103
00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:00.010
Dryer lint is carbon rich and will decompose easily.

104
00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:03.850
And surprisingly hair and fur contains tons of nitrogen

105
00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:06.650
perfect for the healthy compost pile.

106
00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.920
Okay go to the bonus Sex and the City question.

107
00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:09.923
Okay.

108
