149
00:05:44.127 --> 00:05:46.340
But if it didn't have the grease and cheese in it?

150
00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:47.173
You can.

151
00:05:47.173 --> 00:05:51.070
I have to say that my body responds like a recycling bin.

152
